  "summary_en": "Italy's national AI Strategic Programme 2022-2024 sets 6 objectives, 11 priority sectors and 24 policies across talent, research and applications, anchored to EU AI approaches. It creates a permanent interministerial AI working group for governance and proposes national certification of high-risk AI products and regulatory sandboxes. It has no robotics-specific provisions.",
